Hi Mara!

Here's the Jan-Feb appointment export you asked for - it's in the shared
drive under Advising > appt-export-jan-feb.xlsx: every booking, request
date and first-available date. That's the data for the wait-time look you
offered on Tuesday, so it's all yours.

A few notes so you're not guessing:

- It covers 4 Jan - 26 Feb, all advising appointment types (walk-ins
  aren't in there - we don't book those).
- One row per booking. "Request date" is when the student asked;
  "first-available" is the first open slot the system offered them, so
  the gap between the two is the wait.
- There's a student-type column (first-year / continuing / transfer) -
  I figured you'd want to split out the transfer students first.
- No names or student IDs - just row numbers.

No-show rates to follow next week - I need to pull those from a separate
report and it's a bit fiddly, since a no-show and a same-day cancellation
end up in the same status code.

Honestly so glad someone is looking at this with real numbers!

Tillie

